@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5081
@apiKey = devkey

### List Alert
GET {{HostAddress}}/alert/list
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Reset Alert (forget what was already alerted)
POST {{HostAddress}}/alert/reset
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Clear Alert (empty the list; the "already alerted" memory is kept)
POST {{HostAddress}}/alert/clear
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
